{
  "$comment": [
    "SOURCE REGISTRY — the single place a published market figure may live.",
    "",
    "Every entry carries who published it, what period it measures, when they",
    "published, and when we last verified. Those are four different facts and",
    "the schema refuses to let them collapse into one.",
    "",
    "classification is one of:",
    "  OFFICIAL · PRIMARY    Dubai Land Department / Dubai Pulse",
    "  OFFICIAL · AUTHORITY  CBUAE, ADREC, UAE Government, Dubai Government",
    "  THIRD-PARTY           named private research, dated",
    "  MODELLED              our own calculation, methodology mandatory",
    "  USER INPUT            calculator output, never stored here",
    "",
    "The bare word 'Official' is not a valid classification and never appears.",
    "",
    "'published' is month-granular where the exact release day is not known.",
    "Inventing a day to look precise is the failure this registry exists to",
    "prevent."
  ],

